  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Engram</strong></p><p><strong>Inception:</strong> Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against a target within Very Close range. On a success, <strong>spend a Hope</strong> to plant a suggestion in their mind. They are compelled to follow a simple, non-harmful command (like 'let us pass' or 'look away') or believe a plausible lie until the scene ends or they take damage.</p><p><strong>Revitalize:</strong> Make a <strong>Power Roll (13)</strong> and target a creature other than yourself within Melee range. On a success, <strong>mark a Stress</strong> to clear a Hit Point or 2 Stress on the target. The same target cannot be healed by this feature again until their next rest.</p>",
